rowup_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"うひひ、これで思いっきり爆破できそう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"大丈夫、完璧に理解したから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"へへ、へへ、燃える！燃え盛っちゃう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"この水着、ちょっと小さくて肌に食い込んじゃうんだよね……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"でも、それがいいんだ……はぁ、はぁ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"水泳？もちろんできるよ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"オペレーターとはいえ、SRTの一員だからね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"紺碧の海を眺めてると驚異以上に恐怖を感じる時があるんだよね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"底の見えない、あの深淵に落ちちゃったら…… どれだけ破滅的な気分になるんだろうってね……はぁ、はぁ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"うぅ、お腹すいた……先生、何か甘いもの持ってない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"くさや……食べ過ぎたのかな……口の中の生臭さが消えないよ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"いらっしゃい、先生。今日はどのビーチを爆撃しに行く？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_LogIn_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_LogIn_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"あ、先生の指示を待ってたんだ。 いつでも起爆できるよう、たくさん爆弾を設置しておいたよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_LogIn_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_LogIn_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"そんな指示したことないって…？ まぁまぁ、別にいいじゃん。くひひ…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_LogIn_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"うーん。何回見ても 火力弱く感じるなぁ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ま、煙が出てるからいっか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"なんか……この匂いを 嗅ぐのも、久しぶりだなぁ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"SRTに居たころ……いや、 それよりずっと前かも？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_MemorialLobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"これを嗅いでいると、 昔の夏を思い出すんだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_MemorialLobby_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ほんと、不思議。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"これは虫にとって有害な 破滅の香りなのに、  人によっては懐かしく 感じるなんて……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_MemorialLobby_3_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"人って、案外破滅が 好きなのかも。 くひひ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_MemorialLobby_3_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生。 もうちょっとこっちに寄れる？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生に悪い虫が寄ってきたら 大変だし……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_MemorialLobby_4_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"今晩はこれをたっぷり 浴びてこうね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_MemorialLobby_4_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"障害物があったらいつでも呼んで、きれいに爆破してあげる！くひひ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Relationship_Up_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"いつか耐えきれないくらい追い詰められたら、私を呼んで。どんな破滅でも付き合ってあげるからさ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Relationship_Up_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生を見てると、破滅の境界が曖昧になっちゃうんだよねー。困るなー。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Relationship_Up_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ありがとう、先生。おかげで人の心も爆弾みたいに爆発するって知っちゃったからさ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Relationship_Up_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Season_Birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"誕生日プレゼントに欲しいもの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Season_Birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Season_Birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"うーん……服のお直し券かなぁ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Season_Birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Season_Birthday_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"服をバストサイズに合わせて買うといつもサイズが微妙に合わないんだよね。丈短いのに袖余っちゃってさ～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Season_Birthday_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"お誕生日おめでとう、先生。 今年はろうそくじゃなくて爆弾の導火線を吹き消してみるのはどう？ きっと忘れられない思い出になるよ。くひひ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Season_Halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"お化けの仮装が多いと思ったら、もうハロウィンか……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Season_Halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Season_Halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……ん？お化けは怖くないのかって？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Season_Halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Season_Halloween_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"まさか、全然。すでに破滅してしまった存在でしょ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Season_Halloween_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"明けましておめでとう、先生。今年もたくさんの支援、期待してるからね。ふふ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Season_NewYear.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Season_Xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生。クリスマス、時間あったら子ウサギ公園に寄って。 バーベキューパーティーをする予定なんだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Season_Xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Season_Xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"大きな七面鳥はもちろん……特製のくさやも用意してるからね。 くひひ… あ、もちろん小隊の皆には内緒だよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Season_Xmas_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Tactic_Defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"うーん、もっと補給があったなら……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Tactic_Defeat_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Tactic_Defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"ごめん、ちょっと戦況を分析する。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Tactic_Defeat_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Tactic_In_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"ん~久々に身体を動かすか~","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Tactic_In_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Tactic_In_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"オペレーターを戦闘に立たせるなんて、ひどいよねー","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Tactic_In_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Tactic_Victory_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"あれ、もう終わり？まだ爆弾残ってるのに～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Tactic_Victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Tactic_Victory_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"この数で解決できないなら、もっともっとたくさん用意すればいいってことだよね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Tactic_Victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0216_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ブル～～～アーカイブ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0216_Title.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0216_battle_buffed_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0216_battle_buffed_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0216_battle_buffself_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0216_battle_buffself_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0216_battle_covered_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0216_battle_covered_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0216_battle_damage_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_o